            "instructions": "IMPORTANT: Immediately upon saving a newly uploaded FDD that is a state approval, all prospects in Steps 6-8 from the affected areas will roll back to Step 5 (Signed NDA) and receive a system-generated email informing them that a new FDD has been uploaded. \r\n\r\nImmediately upon saving a newly uploaded FDD that is a baseline FDD or federal amendment, all prospects in Steps 6-8 who are in approved areas will roll back to step 5 and receive an email stating a new FDD has been issued. Prospects in non-approved areas will roll back to Step 3 and not receive an email. These users will need to be manually placed in step 4 when the new FDD is approved for those areas.",
